cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LEKS in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "LEKS: local search for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  LEKS is a local search engine for coding agents. It indexes a project's notes, decisions,
  PDFs, Word files and code, answers an agent's question with the passages that answer it,
  each cited by file and line, ranks a replaced note below the note that replaced it, and
  runs its index and models on the user's machine. Claude Code, GitHub Copilot and Codex
  reach it through the Model Context Protocol.
type: software
authors:
